.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-session-watch 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-session\-watch \- Wait until a child session is done, dead or never started, from its transcript alone
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten session watch\fR [\fB\-\-session\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-server\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Wait until a child session is done, dead or never started, from its transcript alone
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fI<server>\fR
The `[[mcp.source]]` server that answers the session toolbox\*(Aqs methods
.TP
\fB\-\-session\fR \fI<session>\fR
A session to watch instead of this session\*(Aqs unarchived children (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
